backups/
*.sql
tmp/
.probe/
# Session cookie jars from verification scripts
cookies.txt

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Agent workspace
#
# Only the steering documents are versioned. Everything else under `.kiro` is
# local working material: 12 GB of it at the time this rule was written.
#
# Three separate reasons, and each one alone is sufficient:
#
#   - `session/` holds full chat transcripts. Anything pasted into a
#     conversation - a database password, a device admin credential - is in
#     there verbatim. Committing it publishes it.
#   - `docs/` holds vendor SDK archives, installers and DLLs. Redistributing
#     those is not ours to do, and one file exceeds GitHub's 100 MB limit, so
#     the push would be refused outright.
#   - `*.sql` dumps carry `user_accounts`, `sessions` and `api_tokens` - hashed
#     passwords, TOTP secrets and live session tokens for real staff.
#
# Steering is the exception because it is the reasoning behind the code, and it
# belongs beside the code it explains.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.kiro/*
!.kiro/steering/

# Editor / OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json

# Local archives
*.zip
*.rar
*.7z
